    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you for clarifying Jiqiang. I looked at the manual, before posting. But I wasn&#39;t 100% sure I understood  the critical sentence contrasting change or variables and transformations.<br><br>Bob, that warning didn&#39;t spook me per se, since I get it with almost every model. But in this specific model It worried me since I wasn&#39;t sure if the transformation, r&lt;-exp(R), I was applying should be seen as a parameter transformation or not.<br></div>"
    ]
   ]
